5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm ready to find the werewolf and protect everyone. I think we should be honest about what we find, but we have to be careful not to give the wolf an easy target.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"I agree with the sentiment, Takumi. However, we must be cautious. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become an immediate target for the wolf. A balanced approach to sharing information is likely our best bet.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's just try to be kind and trust each other, okay? I agree with George—we should keep the Seer safe so they can help us find the wolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with George. If the Seer is too open, they'll be eliminated quickly, and we'll lose our only reliable source of information. It's better to be cautious for now.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I agree with George and Misaki! We have to protect the Seer, right? I'll follow whatever the grown-ups think is the safest way to win! Let's find that werewolf!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I get it, but if we're too quiet, the wolf just blends in! I'll keep my eyes open and think carefully. Let's just make sure we're all paying attention to who says what.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Observation is key, Takumi. I intend to watch how each of you reacts to the information that emerges. Consistency in one's behavior often reveals more than words ever could. Let us remain vigilant.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds a bit scary, George! But you're right, we have to be careful. I'll do my best to help everyone! Let's all just stay positive and work together to keep our friends safe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Consistency is important, but we shouldn't overanalyze every small detail too early. Let's focus on the general flow of the conversation first. It's easier to spot a lie when there's a clear pattern to compare it to.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Patterns? I don't really know about patterns, but I'll watch really closely! @Misaki, you're so smart! I'll just listen to you and George and help however I can!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not just going to sit back and watch! I'll be the one to lead us to the truth. Just remember, if someone starts acting too suspicious or trying to steer us away from the truth, I'm calling them out!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Confidence is admirable, Takumi, but leadership without patience can lead to mistakes. Let us avoid hasty accusations. A calm, methodical approach will serve us better than impulsive calls when the stakes are this high.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't be too mean to anyone! I know you just want to protect us, but let's try to stay friends while we play. I'm sure we can find the wolf together if we're all nice!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, being too aggressive might just create confusion. If we rush to accusations without evidence, we might accidentally execute a villager. Let's keep things calm and logical to avoid making mistakes.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, don't be too scary! @Misaki is right, we shouldn't make mistakes. I'll stay calm and listen to everyone, just like the big kids! I'm ready for the adventure!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, I'll try to be patient, but I won't let the wolf trick us! I've got a plan to find the truth. Let's get through the first night and see what happens. I'm ready!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,"Very well. Let us proceed into the first night with a clear mind. I shall be observing everyone's conduct closely tomorrow. Sleep well, everyone; I hope we wake to find our numbers still intact.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Goodnight, everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and wake up feeling great tomorrow morning! Let's all do our best to protect each other. See you all in the morning!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. Let's hope the Seer gets a useful result tonight. I'll be waiting to see how the situation develops tomorrow. See you all then.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be super awake tomorrow! I hope the Seer finds something really cool! See you all in the morning! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
