31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, the first night is over! I've got some information. @George, you're human, so we can trust you for now. Let's use this to narrow down who the wolf could be!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi, you are claiming to be the Seer? While I appreciate the confirmation of my identity, revealing yourself so early is exactly the risk I warned about. Are you certain this is the wisest course of action?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, you're so brave for telling us! But @George is right, it's a little scary that you're out in the open now. Please be careful! I'm so glad we have someone helping us find the wolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, revealing yourself this early is quite a gamble. While it's helpful to know George is human, you've now made yourself the primary target for the werewolf. I hope your information is accurate enough to justify the risk.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so cool for being the Seer! But @Misaki and @George are worried, so maybe you should be careful? I trust you, Takumi! Who else do we need to look at?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about the risk! If I stay hidden, the wolf just wins by tricking us. Now that we know @George is safe, we can focus on the others. @Yumi, @Misaki, @Rin—one of you is the wolf!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi"",""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi, your eagerness is noted, but remember that the Possessed also appears human to the Seer. Even if you are the Seer, we cannot blindly trust your results without observing the others' reactions. Let us see how the others respond.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, that's so scary! I can't believe one of us is the wolf! I promise I'm just a normal girl who wants everyone to be happy. I'll do whatever it takes to help you find the real wolf!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your approach is very direct, but it puts a lot of pressure on us. Since George is confirmed human, we should look for contradictions in how the rest of us react to this news rather than just guessing.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so direct! It's like a real detective movie! @Misaki, you're right, we should look for contradictions. I'm just a kid, so I'll trust you and George to tell me who's acting weird!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, you're always talking about ""patterns"" and ""contradictions,"" but you're just trying to stall! @Yumi and @Rin seem genuinely scared, but you're too calm. Tell me, why are you so focused on the process instead of the wolf?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Yumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Takumi, please compose yourself. Misaki's desire for a logical process is not evidence of guilt; in fact, your sudden aggression toward her is more jarring than her calmness. Let us not let emotion cloud our judgment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't be so mean to Misaki! She's just trying to be helpful and careful, like George. Let's not fight with each other, or the wolf will be happy we're arguing! We can do this together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, being calm isn't a crime. If we act on impulse, we're doing the werewolf's work for them. I'm focusing on the process because that's how we avoid making a mistake that costs us the game.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, please stop being so mean! @Misaki is just being careful, like @George said. I don't like it when everyone fights! Let's just listen to the smart people so we can find the wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being mean, I'm being alert! @George, you're human, so you should see that @Misaki is just trying to deflect. I'm sticking to my gut. If we don't act now, the wolf wins. I'm voting for Misaki!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"@Takumi, your ""gut"" is a dangerous tool when it lacks evidence. You have provided no proof of Misaki's guilt other than her temperament. I cannot support a vote based on such flimsy grounds. I shall vote for myself to avoid a mistake.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't do this! I really don't want to vote for anyone, especially when we're all friends. I'll follow what the group decides, but I hope we're not making a mistake! I just want us all to be safe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your insistence on ""gut feelings"" over logic is exactly what a werewolf would use to sow discord. I'm sorry you've decided to target me, but I cannot support a vote based on such an impulsive whim.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi is being really scary, and @George and @Misaki say he's being too impulsive. I don't want to make a mistake! I'll trust @George and @Misaki and not vote for Misaki!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
