64,2,1,talk,George,,"The results are troubling. Misaki was executed, and Takumi was attacked. This suggests the werewolf viewed Takumi as a threat, or perhaps Takumi was the werewolf and the attack was a ruse. We must analyze this carefully.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! I can't believe Misaki is gone and Takumi was attacked! This is so sad! @George, you're right, it's really scary. I'm so worried about who the wolf could be now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Rin,,"It's so scary! Misaki is gone and Takumi got attacked! @George, you're the smartest, please tell us what to do! Was Takumi really the Seer, or was he tricking us? I'm so confused!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, it is too early to be certain. If Takumi were the werewolf, attacking himself is a bold gamble to gain trust. However, if he were the Seer, the wolf simply removed a dangerous witness. We must observe Yumi's reactions.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, why are you looking at me? That's so sad! I'm just a normal girl, and I'm really scared right now. I want to help you find the wolf so we can all be safe! Please trust me!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're looking at Yumi? Is she acting weird? I can't tell because I'm just a kid, but if you think she's suspicious, I'll believe you! @Yumi, are you really just a normal girl?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, your distress is evident, but in this game, emotion can be a mask. I am not accusing you, but I am observing. If Takumi was the Seer, the wolf is among us three. Your reactions are very emotive, which contrasts with the logic we need.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, please don't be so cold! I'm just really upset that our friends are gone! I'm not trying to mask anything, I just care about everyone. I'll do anything to prove I'm on your side!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@George, you're so serious! But if you're observing Yumi, then I'll observe her too! @Yumi, why are you so upset? It's just a game, right? You're making me a little nervous now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,George,,"@Rin, it is precisely because it is a game of deception that we must remain detached. @Yumi, your insistence on being ""just a girl"" is a plea for sympathy, not a logical defense. I shall weigh your words against your actions.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, it hurts that you're being so suspicious of me when I'm just trying to be kind! I'm not trying to trick you, I'm just really sad! Please, let's just trust each other so we can win!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@George is right, we have to be detached! @Yumi, you're being really, really emotional, and that's what @George said could be a mask. I'm starting to think you're acting weird! I'll trust @George's logic!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
